        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Foster, Kurt Cobain, Krist Novoselic\n- Places: Aberdeen, Washington, Tacoma\n- Roles: bassist\n- Topics: Nirvana rehearsal logistics, Kurt Cobain biography\n\nFacts:\n- Kurt Cobain was born on February 20, 1967.\n- Kurt Cobain was an American musician, artist, singer, songwriter, guitarist, and poet.\n- Dave Foster lived hours away from Kurt Cobain and bassist Krist Novoselic in Aberdeen, Washington.\n- Dave Foster's distance required Kurt Cobain and Krist Novoselic to pick him up and bring him to the band's rehearsal space in Tacoma.\n- Kurt Cobain died on April 5, 1994.",
